{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-hbtower-2-dot-6m-telescopic-ladder-2603-0165","content_id":"1e9fc95b-11b2-426d-a2a8-e3acd486633f","description":"Product Safety Report for HBTower 2.6M Telescopic Ladder presenting a serious risk of injuries.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"ad6c0ca3-918f-4630-af2f-282e886759d1","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-04-10T09:53:41+01:00","id":"ad6c0ca3-918f-4630-af2f-282e886759d1","title":"Link to Product Image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-04-10T09:53:41+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69d8ba95eff9f7b7e0b3d28f/2603-0165-product-safety-report-hbtower-telescopic-ladder.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: HBTower 2.6M Telescopic Ladder</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a serious risk of injuries as it cannot not hold the claimed weight without collapsing.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The import has been rejected at the border.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Hand tools/accessories - Ladders (Non-Powered)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>HBTower</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model</td>\n      <td>ZL0109</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>SKU</td>\n      <td>EUAZKUHR-ZL01260008</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Barcode</td>\n      <td>921259522424</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Other Product Identifiers</td>\n      <td>B25122563840310, REV251225143041(1), D96860773497</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>A 2.6M telescopic folding ladder.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_ad6c0ca3-918f-4630-af2f-282e886759d1\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69d8ba95eff9f7b7e0b3d28f/2603-0165-product-safety-report-hbtower-telescopic-ladder.pdf\">Link to Product Image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a serious risk of injuries as it cannot not hold the claimed weight without collapsing. If the ladder were to collapse during use, the user could fall from a height receiving serious injuries. The base width and rung clearances also do not meet minimum dimensional requirements. Improvements are also required to product marking and labelling.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the General Product Safety Regulations 2005.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The import has been rejected at the border.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2603-0165</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-04-10T08:54:47Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"hand-tools","product_measure_type":["import-rejected-at-border"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-04-09","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-04-10T09:54:47+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-hbtower-2-dot-6m-telescopic-ladder-2603-0165","api_url":"h